sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Sam as Sam (child)
  participant T as Twig
  actor Mom as Mom (parent)
  Sam->>T: Invite: I'm the child, I call her "Mom"
  T-->>Sam: Link and 8-character code, valid 7 days
  Sam->>Mom: Text message with the link and code
  Mom->>Mom: Installs Twig from the App Store
  Mom->>T: Signs in and types the code
  T->>T: Edge Function limits code guesses
  T->>T: accept_invite() locks the invite,<br/>checks blocks and existing pairs
  T-->>Mom: Relationship is active
  T-->>Sam: Mom joined
